  <p class="card-text" data-i18n="shahada_intro"></p>
  <div class="shahada-display" id="shahadaDisplay">
    <div class="shahada-main-text" id="shahadaText">أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا اللَّٰهُ، وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا رَسُولُ اللَّٰهِ</div>
  </div>
  <div class="shahada-divider"><span>۞</span></div>
  <p class="transliteration" id="shahadaTranslit">Ash-hadu an la ilaha illa Allah, wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan rasoolu Allah.</p>
  <p class="translation" data-i18n="shahada_translation"></p>
  <div class="audio-controls">
    <button class="audio-btn" id="audioBtn">
      <svg class="audio-icon-static" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14"/></svg>
      <div class="audio-icon-playing eq"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <span id="audioBtnText" data-i18n="audio_btn"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="voice-row">
      <span data-i18n="voice_label"></span>
      <select class="voice-select" id="voiceSelect"></select>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

